# Scenario: issue #15's ledge (SCENARIO=issue15_ledge) -- the volcano's drop above cave D_60_29's terrace, on the
# way to the fifth temple, at the frame limit the run sets (DOTHEROES_FPS: 30, 60, 144 ...).
#
# Starts from: build/checkpoints/m111-cleared (CONTINUE: the castle front). The developer tools' warp puts the hero
#   at the volcano's entrance (Field_7's gate f6t7_1, where walking in from Field_6 arrives); from there everything
#   is ordinary movement: east along the bottom, three staircases north, the long staircase
#   north to the top plateau (height 28.8), south along it and east along the ledge to the column of its drop point
#   at (84.0, -159.2), just left of the pink rocks.
# A drop is a map object (AT_FALL_POINT): the hero gets down only after pushing toward it for 0.5 s without a break
#   (port/game_patches.cpp, g_dotheroes_fallpoint30). The checks read the hero's height from the game:
#   - on the ledge, 28.8, before anything is pressed;
#   - a brief tap of DOWN at the edge: still 28.8;
#   - DOWN held 0.4 s and released, twice (each under 0.5 s, together over it): still 28.8 -- the hold restarts;
#   - sideways along the edge, LEFT, RIGHT, then DOWN+LEFT pressed into it: still 28.8;
#   - DOWN held: on the terrace below, 22.4 -- the drop (the bug: at 60 fps the hero stayed at 28.8);
#   - then on, by ordinary movement: west along the terrace and UP into the cave's mouth -- the cave (area 139),
#     so the drop left no softlock.
# Fails at the first check not met (the run's drive status); positions logged throughout ("POS x,y,z").
#! secs 1100
#! saves build/checkpoints/m111-cleared
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_CANT_DIE=1 PS3_VERBOSE=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
include common.drive
block pos
  dev lua local p = actor_manager.gActorManager:getActor(0):getPosition(); return string.format("POS %.2f,%.2f,%.2f", p.x, p.y, p.z)
end
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
sleep 8
press CROSS                 # "Change characters?" NO, when a slow first start missed the first
state life>0 120
sleep 3
devtry warp Field_7 -gf6t7_1 @150
sleep 4
call pos
state area==6,hy<0.5 5
# the bottom, then the first staircase
goto 63.6 -194.4 0.4 30
goto 63.6 -198.4 0.4 30
goto 81.2 -198.4 0.4 30
goto 81.2 -192.4 0.4 30
goto 78.8 -193.0 0.4 30
goto 66.8 -193.0 0.4 30
# the second staircase, then west
goto 66.8 -184.4 0.4 30
goto 64.4 -184.4 0.4 20
goto 64.4 -185.2 0.4 20
goto 62.8 -185.2 0.4 20
goto 62.8 -186.0 0.4 20
goto 59.6 -186.0 0.4 20
# the third staircase, then the long staircase to the top plateau
goto 59.6 -170.8 0.4 30
goto 66.8 -170.8 0.4 30
goto 66.8 -156.4 0.4 30
goto 67.6 -142.8 0.4 30
call pos
state hy>28.7 5
# south along the plateau, east along the ledge
goto 71.6 -142.8 0.4 20
goto 71.6 -146.8 0.4 20
goto 72.8 -150.4 0.4 20
goto 74.0 -154.8 0.4 20
goto 75.6 -157.2 0.4 20
goto 84.0 -157.6 0.3 20
goto 84.0 -158.9 0.3 10
call pos
state hy>28.7,hx>83.6,hx<84.4 3
shot ledge-before
# a brief tap
press DOWN 6
sleep 1.5
call pos
state hy>28.7 2
# early releases: the hold restarts
write pad.txt 0x0040 1 400
sleep 1.2
write pad.txt 0x0040 1 400
sleep 1.2
call pos
state hy>28.7 2
# sideways along the edge, and pressed into it while moving along it
hold LEFT 1.0
hold RIGHT 1.0
goto 84.0 -158.9 0.3 10
hold 0x00C0 1.0
call pos
state hy>28.7 2
shot ledge-sideways
# the drop
goto 84.0 -157.6 0.3 15
goto 84.0 -158.9 0.3 10
hold DOWN 1.6
sleep 1.5
call pos
state hy<22.5,hy>22.3 5
shot terrace-after
# on: the cave's mouth in the terrace's north wall
goto 76.0 -164.4 0.3 15
cross UP 139 10
sleep 2
call pos
state area==139 5
shot cave
dev perf
